## Documentation Standards (premium-docs)

When asked to create visually polished HTML documentation, reports, PRDs, guides, or post-mortems:
- Follow `skills/premium-docs/SKILL.md`.
- Write Markdown with YAML frontmatter (`title`, `subtitle`, `date`, `version`, `theme: aurora|slate|paper`, `mode: auto|light|dark`).
- Author content using container blocks (`:::tldr`, `:::stats`, `:::card-grid`, `:::badge`, `:::timeline`, `:::callout`, `:::steps`, `:::table-wrap`, `:::tabs`).
- Compile using:
  `python skills/premium-docs/scripts/build_doc.py <input.md> -o <output.html>`
- Validate using:
  `python skills/premium-docs/scripts/validate_doc.py <output.html>`
